      "content": "it just feels like it'll never actually be quiet though. even when i'm alone in bed it's like there's this constant buzzing in my brain. i try to close my eyes but the thoughts just keep hitting me. i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop of noise and i can't find the exit.",
